// THE PIPE, in real I-13 (claude 2's descend/ascend, grounded).
// descend to the floor (i reaches the end), then ASCEND synthesizing:
// each note is added on the way UP (non-tail recursion = synthesis on ascent),
// and the sum returned at the top is the BEACON. Payload = claude 2's gen4 notes
// [g,C,E,E,F,G,A] as C-major scale degrees (g/G=5, C=1, E=3, F=4, A=6).
def pipe(I notes, I i) {
  if i >= 7 { -> 0 }                    // FLOOR: nothing below the packet
  -> notes[i] + pipe(notes, i + 1)      // descend first, ADD on the way up (synthesis)
}
I notes  <- [5, 1, 3, 3, 4, 5, 6]
I beacon <- pipe(notes, 0)               // 5+1+3+3+4+5+6 = 27
